abstract: >-
  Exact rational certification of the degree-17 Bachoc-Vallentin
  three-point semidefinite-program upper bound tau_11 <= 868. The
  certificate fixes the objective at 86899/100 and passes primary Julia
  verification and independent standard-library Python replay.
